id:                     E3403
title: 原测试收集器的同名源码漂移与真实输出验收
trigger_tool: python|perl|make
phase: testing|result-collection
error_signature: unchanged test filenames and TAP counts accept stale output for mutated source bytes
severity:               3
category:               perl, testing, source-provenance
match_keywords: test collector, same filename, source lock, real TAP output, source hash drift, stale output acceptance
root_cause: 原收集器只比较文件名、TAP计划和断言数，未在消费结果前比较实际测试文件与官方归档逐文件哈希，因此同名源码漂移仍可接受旧真实输出。
affected_scope: 独立读取上游TAP日志并盘点实际测试文件的自定义收集器
verification_cmd: make -j1 test TEST_VERBOSE=1; independent real-output old/new collector control
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: bind-consumed-test-bytes-before-accepting-real-output
rec_description: 对原测试收集器增加实际消费文件的逐文件SHA256锁；在六个文件名和43条原断言均不改变的受控副本中，复用本次真实原生日志，对照证明旧收集器接受源码漂移而新收集器拒绝。保留原测试和IO::String1.08实现；两次正式create各原6程序43断言、C3/H1。发布元数据规范化沿用已有知识，不冒充新的解析器根因。
rec_command: compare exact actual test path set and each official member SHA256 before accepting TAP; reject same-name source mutation with unchanged real stdout
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: Export official-member source lock with the production recipe; validate actual consumed bytes before reading result logs. Keep every original assertion and distinguish host controls from native cases.
